Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `twice` wants a number (a `Numeric` type such as Int) for argument 1, but this is Bool (true or false)
  --> tests/ui/numeric_bound_argument_not_a_number.jet:6:17
    |
  6 |     print(twice(true))
    |                 ^^^^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Use a number here, such as Int (a whole number)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112

